From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maplibre-plugins <sync@localhost>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:14:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Carry plugin rotation properties

Adds MLN_PLUGIN_VALUE_ROTATION to the plugin layer ABI: degrees in
float_value whose transitions follow the shortest arc, like the built-in
rotation properties. Not yet proposed upstream.

Carried by maplibre-plugins until it lands upstream.
